{
  "name": "Owner's Manual, third edition",
  "adopted": "2026-02-01",
  "summary": "About ten businesses sorted into Compounder, Transitional and Growth archetypes, each with a position cap, judged on written fundamentals thresholds and bought only at a discount to the owner's own valuation. Returns are context, never the verdict.",
